---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const webPageSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Financial and Affiliate Disclaimer",
  "description": "Get Global Yields is a publisher of financial information, not an investment advisor - what that means for our broker reviews, affiliate links, and content accuracy.",
  "url": "https://getglobalyields.com/disclaimer/",
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer - Get Global Yields"
  description="Get Global Yields is a publisher of financial information, not an investment advisor. Our financial capability disclaimer, affiliate disclosure, and accuracy policy."
>
  <div class="bg-primary-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl">
      <article class="prose prose-invert prose-lg prose-a:text-accent-500 hover:prose-a:text-accent-400 max-w-none">
        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

        <div class="bg-primary-800 border-l-4 border-accent-500 p-6 rounded-r-lg mb-8">
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-100 !my-0">
            The information provided on Get Global Yields is for educational and informational purposes only. It should not be construed as specific financial, investment, or tax advice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Financial Capability Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Get Global Yields is a publisher of financial information, not an investment advisor. We do not provide personalized or individualized investment advice. The strategies and investments discussed on our platform - including our <a href="/strategies/">leveraged ETF strategy guides</a> and <a href="/taxes/">country-specific tax treaty guides</a> - may not be suitable for all investors. You should always conduct your own research, make your own decisions, and consult a qualified financial or tax professional before making any financial decisions or investments.
        </p>
        <p>
          Past performance is not indicative of future results. All investments involve risk, including the possible loss of principal.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          In compliance with FTC guidelines, please assume that any links on Get Global Yields leading to products or services - including our <a href="/best-brokers/">broker reviews</a> - are affiliate links. This means that if you click on such a link and make a purchase or sign up for an account, we may receive a small commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>
        <p>
          These commissions help maintain the operations of our website and allow us to continue producing high-quality content. However, our reviews and comparisons are written objectively based on our own research and analysis. We only recommend products or services that we believe will add value to our readers.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Accuracy of Information</h2>
        <p>
          While we strive to keep the information on Get Global Yields as accurate and up-to-date as possible, the financial landscape changes rapidly. Interest rates, product features, terms, and conditions are subject to change without notice by the respective financial institutions. Always verify all information directly with the product or service provider before making any commitment.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">No Warranty and Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          The content on Get Global Yields is provided "as is" and "as available," without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or fitness for a particular purpose. We do not warrant that any strategy, calculation, or figure referenced on this site will achieve any particular result.
        </p>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Get Global Yields, its founder, and its contributors will not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or other damages arising from your use of, or reliance on, this site or any decision made based on its content - including losses from investments, trades, or tax positions taken after reading our guides. This limitation applies regardless of the legal theory under which a claim is brought.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">High-Risk Strategies (Leveraged and Inverse ETFs)</h2>
        <p>
          A significant part of this site's <a href="/strategies/">strategy content</a> covers leveraged and inverse ETFs (such as TQQQ and SQQQ). These products use daily-reset leverage and carry substantially higher risk than standard, unleveraged ETFs, including the possibility of losing the large majority - or all - of an invested position, particularly over volatile or extended holding periods. Nothing in our leveraged-ETF content should be read as a recommendation that these products are suitable for your specific risk tolerance, time horizon, or financial situation. These are professional-grade, high-risk instruments, and if you are unfamiliar with daily-reset leverage and volatility decay, we strongly encourage you to research this mechanic thoroughly - starting with our own <a href="/strategies/">strategy guides</a> - and consult a licensed advisor before using them.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          This site links to external websites - brokers, tax authorities, exchanges, and other third-party resources - for your convenience and reference. We do not control, and are not responsible for, the content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices of any third-party site. A link does not imply our endorsement of everything on that site, and third-party terms and conditions apply once you leave Get Global Yields.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Not Licensed Investment Advice Under Israeli Law</h2>
        <p>
          Get Global Yields is operated from Israel. Under Israel's Regulation of Investment Advice, Investment Marketing and Portfolio Management Law, 5755-1995, "investment advice" (ייעוץ השקעות) and "investment marketing" (שיווק השקעות) are specifically defined as recommendations tailored to a particular person's own circumstances, and providing them as a business requires a license from the Israel Securities Authority. Get Global Yields does not provide personalized recommendations to any specific reader about their own portfolio, and neither the site nor its founder is a licensed investment advisor or investment marketer under this law, or licensed as an investment advisor in the United States or any other jurisdiction. The content here is general, publicly available, educational material, not advice directed at any individual's personal circumstances - the same distinction described throughout this page.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
          <em>This section reflects a general, good-faith understanding of the relevant Israeli statute and is not a legal opinion. If you have a specific legal question about the site's regulatory status, consult a securities lawyer licensed in the relevant jurisdiction.</em>
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Related Policies</h2>
        <p>
          See also our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for how we handle personal information, and our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> if you spot something on the site that needs correcting.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(webPageSchema)} />
</BaseLayout>
